# Example ii: a wheeled rover collects a parcel from the mailroom and delivers it to a desk.
# Cleaned up from spec-source/URITP - Google Docs.pdf, following spec/DECISIONS.md:
#   A1  disp became say (so this rover needs the speech profile)
#   A7  no comma before speed
# The places come from site.uritp in this folder (D16).

robot rover = connect("office:rover-2")
move rover.base to places.mailroom
say "Please place the parcel on my tray"
wait until rover.tray.loaded timeout 2min
move rover.base to places.desk_14 speed 0.8m/s
say "Parcel for you"
wait until not rover.tray.loaded timeout 5min
move rover.base to places.dock
